{"meta":{"type":"db","canSave":true,"canEdit":true,"canAdmin":true,"canStar":true,"canDelete":true,"slug":"hope-e28094-vllm-inference","url":"/d/hope-vllm/hope-e28094-vllm-inference","expires":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","created":"2026-11-23T08:49:43Z","updated":"2026-11-23T08:49:43Z","updatedBy":"Anonymous","createdBy":"Anonymous","version":1,"hasAcl":false,"isFolder":false,"apiVersion":"v0alpha1","folderId":3592041725079552,"folderUid":"fg55iamkl37y8d","folderTitle":"HOPE","folderUrl":"/dashboards/f/fg55iamkl37y8d/hope","provisioned":true,"provisionedExternalId":"vllm.json","annotationsPermissions":{"dashboard":{"canAdd":true,"canEdit":true,"canDelete":true}}},"dashboard":{"description":"The vLLM general-inference service (TASK-1021 Phase 1: Whisper ASR pool): traffic and latency by kind, ASR real-time factor, admission and saturation, engine loads and evictions, resident VRAM against the pool budget, and the upstream KV-cache and scheduler series. No tenant label anywhere: this plane stays PHI-free. Panels read \"No data\" until a pool is scaled up and scraped.","editable":true,"graphTooltip":1,"id":3592042488799232,"panels":[{"collapsed":false,"gridPos":{"h":1,"w":24,"x":0,"y":0},"panels":[],"title":"Traffic","type":"row"},{"datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"prometheus"},"description":"Completed requests per second, split by outcome (status label of hope_vllm_requests_total: the HTTP status class the shell answered). A rising non-2xx share is the first thing to read; the rejections panel below says WHY (capacity vs saturation).","fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"custom":{"drawStyle":"line","fillOpacity":10,"pointSize":5,"stacking":{"mode":"none"}},"unit":"reqps"},"overrides":[]},"gridPos":{"h":8,"w":12,"x":0,"y":1},"options":{"legend":{"calcs":["lastNotNull","max"],"displayMode":"table","placement":"bottom"},"tooltip":{"mode":"multi"}},"targets":[{"datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"prometheus"},"expr":"sum by (status) (rate(hope_vllm_requests_total{service=~\"$pool\"}[$__rate_interval]))","legendFormat":"{{status}}","refId":"A"}],"title":"Requests by status","type":"timeseries"},{"datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"prometheus"},"description":"End-to-end request time in the shell (hope_vllm_request_seconds), by request kind (asr in Phase 1). ASR windows are at most 30s of audio, so p99 above 15s is the VllmAsrSlow alert. Includes engine queue wait and, on a cold model, the engine load.","fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"custom":{"drawStyle":"line","fillOpacity":10,"pointSize":5,"stacking":{"mode":"none"}},"unit":"s"},"overrides":[]},"gridPos":{"h":8,"w":12,"x":12,"y":1},"options":{"legend":{"calcs":["lastNotNull","max"],"displayMode":"table","placement":"bottom"},"tooltip":{"mode":"multi"}},"targets":[{"datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"prometheus"},"expr":"histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le, kind) (rate(hope_vllm_request_seconds_bucket{service=~\"$pool\"}[$__rate_interval])))","legendFormat":"p50 {{kind}}","refId":"A"},{"datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"prometheus"},"expr":"histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, kind) (rate(hope_vllm_request_seconds_bucket{service=~\"$pool\"}[$__rate_interval])))","legendFormat":"p95 {{kind}}","refId":"B"},{"datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"prometheus"},"expr":"histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le, kind) (rate(hope_vllm_request_seconds_bucket{service=~\"$pool\"}[$__rate_interval])))","legendFormat":"p99 {{kind}}","refId":"C"}],"title":"Request latency p50 / p95 / p99 by kind","type":"timeseries"},{"datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"prometheus"},"description":"Decode time divided by audio duration (hope_vllm_asr_rtf), p50 and p95 per model. Below 1 the engine decodes faster than real time; the live path needs comfortable headroom under 1, and time-sliced neighbours on the same card push it up.","fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"custom":{"drawStyle":"line","fillOpacity":10,"pointSize":5,"stacking":{"mode":"none"}},"unit":"none"},"overrides":[]},"gridPos":{"h":8,"w":12,"x":0,"y":9},"options":{"legend":{"calcs":["lastNotNull","max"],"displayMode":"table","placement":"bottom"},"tooltip":{"mode":"multi"}},"targets":[{"datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"prometheus"},"expr":"histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le, model) (rate(hope_vllm_asr_rtf_bucket{service=~\"$pool\"}[$__rate_interval])))","legendFormat":"p50 {{model}}","refId":"A"},{"datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"prometheus"},"expr":"histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, model) (rate(hope_vllm_asr_rtf_bucket{service=~\"$pool\"}[$__rate_interval])))","legendFormat":"p95 {{model}}","refId":"B"}],"title":"ASR real-time factor","type":"timeseries"},{"datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"prometheus"},"description":"Requests admitted and being decoded (hope_vllm_inflight) against requests waiting behind them (hope_vllm_queue_depth), per model. In-flight pinned at its cap with a growing queue is saturation (429 engine_saturated).","fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"custom":{"drawStyle":"line","fillOpacity":10,"pointSize":5,"stacking":{"mode":"none"}},"unit":"short"},"overrides":[]},"gridPos":{"h":8,"w":12,"x":12,"y":9},"options":{"legend":{"calcs":["lastNotNull","max"],"displayMode":"table","placement":"bottom"},"tooltip":{"mode":"multi"}},"targets":[{"datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"prometheus"},"expr":"sum by (model) (hope_vllm_inflight{service=~\"$pool\"})","legendFormat":"in-flight {{model}}","refId":"A"},{"datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"prometheus"},"expr":"sum by (model) (hope_vllm_queue_depth{service=~\"$pool\"})","legendFormat":"queued {{model}}","refId":"B"}],"title":"In-flight requests and queue depth","type":"timeseries"},{"collapsed":false,"gridPos":{"h":1,"w":24,"x":0,"y":17},"panels":[],"title":"Admission and engines","type":"row"},{"datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"prometheus"},"description":"Requests the shell refused, per second, by reason: engine_capacity = the pool's VRAM budget could not fit the requested model (503, alert VllmAdmissionRejected); engine_saturated = a resident engine is at its in-flight cap (429, alert VllmSaturated).","fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"custom":{"drawStyle":"line","fillOpacity":10,"pointSize":5,"stacking":{"mode":"none"}},"unit":"reqps"},"overrides":[]},"gridPos":{"h":8,"w":12,"x":0,"y":18},"options":{"legend":{"calcs":["lastNotNull","max"],"displayMode":"table","placement":"bottom"},"tooltip":{"mode":"multi"}},"targets":[{"datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"prometheus"},"expr":"sum by (reason) (rate(hope_vllm_rejections_total{service=~\"$pool\"}[$__rate_interval]))","legendFormat":"{{reason}}","refId":"A"}],"title":"Rejections by reason","type":"timeseries"},{"datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"prometheus"},"description":"Engine memory the pool currently holds (hope_vllm_resident_gib) against the pool's vramBudgetGiB (hope_vllm_vram_budget_gib), shown in bytes so the axis reads GiB. This is the pool's own accounting; the GPU panels on the Model Residency board show the whole card, which under time-slicing includes the neighbours.","fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"custom":{"drawStyle":"line","fillOpacity":10,"pointSize":5,"stacking":{"mode":"none"}},"unit":"bytes"},"overrides":[]},"gridPos":{"h":8,"w":12,"x":12,"y":18},"options":{"legend":{"calcs":["lastNotNull","max"],"displayMode":"table","placement":"bottom"},"tooltip":{"mode":"multi"}},"targets":[{"datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"prometheus"},"expr":"sum by (service) (hope_vllm_resident_gib{service=~\"$pool\"}) * 1024 * 1024 * 1024","legendFormat":"resident {{service}}","refId":"A"},{"datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"prometheus"},"expr":"max by (service) (hope_vllm_vram_budget_gib{service=~\"$pool\"}) * 1024 * 1024 * 1024","legendFormat":"budget {{service}}","refId":"B"}],"title":"Resident VRAM against the pool budget","type":"timeseries"},{"datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"prometheus"},"description":"Engine cold starts by result (hope_vllm_engine_loads_total; result=failed is the VllmEngineLoadFailing alert) and evictions to make room (hope_vllm_engine_evictions_total). Steady evictions on an unpinned model set means the budget is too small for the traffic mix (thrash).","fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"custom":{"drawStyle":"line","fillOpacity":10,"pointSize":5,"stacking":{"mode":"none"}},"unit":"short"},"overrides":[]},"gridPos":{"h":8,"w":12,"x":0,"y":26},"options":{"legend":{"calcs":["lastNotNull","max"],"displayMode":"table","placement":"bottom"},"tooltip":{"mode":"multi"}},"targets":[{"datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"prometheus"},"expr":"sum by (result) (increase(hope_vllm_engine_loads_total{service=~\"$pool\"}[$__rate_interval]))","legendFormat":"loads {{result}}","refId":"A"},{"datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"prometheus"},"expr":"sum(increase(hope_vllm_engine_evictions_total{service=~\"$pool\"}[$__rate_interval]))","legendFormat":"evictions","refId":"B"}],"title":"Engine loads and evictions","type":"timeseries"},{"collapsed":false,"gridPos":{"h":1,"w":24,"x":0,"y":34},"panels":[],"title":"Upstream engine (vllm:*)","type":"row"},{"datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"prometheus"},"description":"Fraction of the engine's GPU KV cache in use (vllm:kv_cache_usage_perc, vLLM V1), per pod and model_name. Above 95% for 5m is the VllmKvCacheFull alert: the scheduler starts preempting and queueing.","fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"custom":{"drawStyle":"line","fillOpacity":10,"pointSize":5,"stacking":{"mode":"none"}},"max":1,"min":0,"unit":"percentunit"},"overrides":[]},"gridPos":{"h":8,"w":12,"x":0,"y":35},"options":{"legend":{"calcs":["lastNotNull","max"],"displayMode":"table","placement":"bottom"},"tooltip":{"mode":"multi"}},"targets":[{"datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"prometheus"},"expr":"max by (pod, model_name) (vllm:kv_cache_usage_perc{service=~\"$pool\"})","legendFormat":"{{pod}} {{model_name}}","refId":"A"}],"title":"KV cache usage","type":"timeseries"},{"datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"prometheus"},"description":"Requests the u